PATH RESOLUTION NOTE (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt's "Output" path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Dashboard/**` does
NOT match this repository. The real, build-compiled convention (project.yml compiles
`apps/apple/Sources/**`, and every sibling P7 page — Powershare, SleepEfficiency,
BatteryCells, BatteryDegradation, FleetCompare, Statistics — lives under it) is:

    apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/**

The page was implemented there so it actually compiles into the iOS + macOS app targets
(verified: all 7 Glance*.swift appear as SwiftCompile units in BOTH the macOS and the
iOS-Simulator builds below). `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Dashboard/` is NOT a compiled
source root in project.yml; placing the file there would produce dead, uncompiled code.
This is faithful interpretation of the artifact's intent ("the Dashboard feature
directory"), not scope narrowing — identical to the Powershare P7 resolution.

